{"availability":"available","full":"ajithrn/wckerala-frames","name":"wckerala-frames","description":"WordCamp Kerala 2024 Frames for social media","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":1,"created":"2024-10-03T22:01:47Z","updated":"2026-09-02T04:30:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://frames.wpkerala.org/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:30.462Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:30.462Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:30.462Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:38:30.462Z","stars":0,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static, browser-based frame generator for events organised by the WordPress community in Kerala. Visitors add a photo, pick a role frame, and download or share a personalised graphic. The current event is WP Future Conclave 2026; earlier collections stay available through the archive.","All image compositing runs on the Canvas API in the visitor's browser. Photos are never uploaded to a server."],"features":["Event-driven — one codebase serves every event from a single catalog, with per-event artwork, layout, and copy.","Two layouts — an aperture mode for overlay frames with a transparent photo window, and a legacy mode for the 2024 photo-and-text design.","Guided workflow — collapsible, numbered step cards for photo, details, frame, and crop, with a live preview.","Flexible input — upload or drag-and-drop an image, or opt in to Gravatar (SHA-256 with an MD5 fallback).","On-frame text — optional name and company, positioned per event."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ajithrn/wckerala-frames/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4dc260e5168bd9245b0ebdfd38f41307ed7b009fb6cb015f1cc388c19228d5dd","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:30.835Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:30.835Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A static, browser-based frame generator for events organised by the W